---
// About — system profile
---
<section id="about" aria-label="About Marco Fornari">
  <div class="sheet">
    <div class="split">
      <div class="stick">
        <p class="kicker rv" data-i18n="about.kicker">01 / ABOUT — SYSTEM PROFILE</p>
        <h2 class="rv d1">Marco<br>Fornari</h2>
        <p class="lede rv d2" style="margin-top:24px" data-i18n="about.lede">Developer building software.<br>Cybersecurity enthusiast trying to understand where systems fail.</p>
        <div class="block rv d3" style="margin-top:44px">
          <h3>Trajectory</h3>
          <p class="traj">
            2022–24 &nbsp;STORYTELLING · AUDIOVISUAL<br>
            2025–26 &nbsp;WEB &amp; SOFTWARE DEVELOPMENT<br>
            2026&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <b>SECURITY-FOCUSED DEVELOPMENT</b>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="copy">
        <div class="block rv">
          <h3>Profile</h3>
          <p data-i18n="about.p1">Marco is a <strong>Junior Developer</strong> with experience developing <strong>applications, APIs, databases</strong> and custom software solutions.</p>
          <p data-i18n="about.p2">He is currently building a serious specialization in <strong>cybersecurity</strong>, working on <strong>Overguard</strong> — an anti-phishing platform — and studying how software fails: phishing, threat intelligence, cyber risk and application security.</p>
          <p data-i18n="about.p3">Before writing code he spent two years running audiovisual productions end-to-end. That background still shapes how he works: visual thinking, client communication, planning, and staying calm under pressure.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="block rv">
          <h3>Current stack</h3>
          <div class="taglist">
            <span class="tag">C#</span><span class="tag">.NET</span><span class="tag">ASP.NET CORE</span>
            <span class="tag">JAVASCRIPT</span><span class="tag">FLUTTER</span><span class="tag">SQL</span>
            <span class="tag">POSTGRESQL</span><span class="tag">GIT</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="block rv">
          <h3>Security focus</h3>
          <div class="taglist">
            <span class="tag hot">PHISHING DETECTION</span>
            <span class="tag hot">THREAT INTELLIGENCE</span>
            <span class="tag hot">CYBER RISK</span>
            <span class="tag hot">DATA PROTECTION</span>
            <span class="tag hot">APPLICATION SECURITY</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="block rv">
          <h3>Philosophy</h3>
          <p class="philosophy" data-i18n="about.phil.body">Build systems.<br>Understand risks.<br><em>Improve security.</em></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
